<title>USA: NYPA issues spot tender for residual fuel oil.</title>
<headline>NYPA issues spot tender for residual fuel oil.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The New York Power Authority issued a spot tender for 200,000 barrels of 0.3 percent high pour residual fuel for New York Harbor delivery by February 3-7, the state agency said in a statement Tuesday.</p>
<p>Fixed price bids only were due by 1100 EST Wednesday, January 29.</p>
<p>--((J Silha, New York Power Desk 212-859-1624))</p>
